  "description": "Variation of condition 2 (opening hours) attached to planning permission LBH/31013 dated 6/11/1985 to allow change of operating hours from 07:30 and 18:30 hours Monday to Saturday inclusive and not at any times on Sunday to 10:00 and 23:00 hours Monday to Sunday including bank holidays",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Kenton East",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-06T09:58:36.547Z",
  "street_name": "KENTON ROAD",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;The proposed extension of the permitted operating hours from 07:30 to 18:30 hours Monday to Saturday only, to 10:00 to 23:00 hours Monday to Sunday including Bank Holidays, would result in a significant intensification of activity during evening periods and on days when the premises are currently closed. The extended hours would likely give rise to increased noise, disturbance, vehicle movements, customer activity, and general comings and goings at times when neighbouring occupiers would reasonably expect a greater level of tranquillity. As such, the proposal would have an unacceptable adverse impact on the living conditions and residential amenity of nearby residents, contrary to Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan and Policy D3 and D14 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
